              "inline_data": null,
              "text": "Because *Miraculous: Tales of Ladybug & Cat Noir* has been released in different orders globally across television networks and streaming platforms, **Season 2, Episode 12** refers to different episodes depending on the guide you are looking at. \n\nBelow are the release dates for the three most common episodes designated as \"Season 2, Episode 12\":\n\n### 1. **\"Captain Hardrock\"** (Standard English & Streaming Order)\nIn many international broadcasting schedules, official guides (like TVmaze or Apple TV), and streaming platforms, **\"Captain Hardrock\"** (production code 216) is listed as Season 2, Episode 12.\n* **US Release Date (Netflix):** March 30, 2018\n* **Original Air Date (France - TFOU):** May 20, 2018\n\n### 2. **\"Sapotis\"** (Production Code Order)\nIn terms of production order, the twelfth episode produced for Season 2 is **\"Sapotis\"** (production code 212), which features Alya receiving the Fox Miraculous to become Rena Rouge. \n* **Original Air Date (France - TFOU):** January 21, 2018\n* **US Release Date (Netflix):** March 30, 2018\n\n### 3. **\"Gorizilla\"** (Worldwide Premiere Order)\nIf you are looking at the chronological order of when the episodes actually debuted to the public for the very first time, the 12th episode to air globally was **\"Gorizilla\"** (production code 210).\n* **World Premiere (Canada - Family Channel):** March 14, 2018\n* **France Air Date (TFOU):** May 13, 2018",
